                    'PEG. THE NUMBER IS NOT WRONG - IT IS MANUFACTURED BY A DATA PIPELINE THAT DIVIDED SOMETHING BY '
                    'SOMETHING AND PRINTED THE RESULT. ⚠️ AND NOTE THE SLIDE\'S OWN SOURCE LINE: "Yahoo Finance, '
                    'MarketWatch, and other publicly available data" - YAHOO FINANCE IS ON THIS BOARD\'S BLACKLIST, '
                    'AND THIS IS PRECISELY WHY. || ⚠️⚠️ FAULT TWO - IT DIVIDES BY A FORECAST. THE "G" IN PEG IS AN '
                    'ESTIMATE OF FUTURE GROWTH, NOT A FACT. Every PEG on that slide is a real number divided by '
